      "filename": "George Gabriel Stokes in Pembroke College admissions book.jpg",
      "title": "File:George Gabriel Stokes in Pembroke College admissions book.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/George_Gabriel_Stokes_in_Pembroke_College_admissions_book.jpg",
