      "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0",
      "artist": "Teresa Stokes",
      "description": "Stokes Georgius Gabriel filius natu quartus\nReverendi viri Gabriel Stokes de Skreen\nin Comitatu de Sligo in Hibernias Rectoris\nibidem natus atque annum agens undevi\ncesimum admissus est ad mensam secundam\nsub tutore magistri Arlett, Julii 7 1837\ntranslated as\nStokes George Gabriel fourth son of the Reverend Gabriel Stokes, Rector of Skreen in county Sligo in Ireland, born there, and having reached his nineteenth year, was admitted to the second [undergraduate] table under the Tutor, Mr Arlett, July 7 1837.\n\nMarginal annotations indicate that he was a Foundation Fellow from January 1841 and Master ('custos') 1902.",
